      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILD BOSS LADY (1) is on debut with a good inside draw a bonus. Leading chance to break through. GOLDEN ALLEGRA (2) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing second and beaten 2.5 lengths (26.28) at this track in a Maiden over 460m. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Well placed and gets her chance. BLUE POOLS (5) steps out at this track for the first time after an average run at the latest appearance, finishing fourth at Healesville over 300m behind Aston Hopkins (16.93). Expected to feature in the finish. LUCKY LIMO (8) makes debut for the Gavin Kearns kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Respect any moves in the market.",
